{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>The uncleanness of a person.</b> This is the uncleanness of a corpse." "<b>For any of his uncleanness.</b> To include the uncleanness of contact with a zav and a zavah." "<b>That he becomes unclean.</b> To include one who touches one who had intercourse with a menstruating woman." "<b>In it.</b> To include one who swallows the carcass of a clean bird (Sifra)." "<b>And it is hidden.</b> And he did not know that he forgot the uncleanness." "<b>And he bears guilt.</b> By eating consecrated food or by entering the Sanctuary."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:05:03.419462341Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}